---
const points = [
  { title: 'Built for aesthetic practices', text: 'We speak the language of consultations, procedures and patient trust, so nothing is lost in translation.' },
  { title: 'Content handled, start to finish', text: 'Strategy, shoots, reels, captions and posting are done for you. You approve, we publish.' },
  { title: 'Measured by booked consults', text: 'Likes are nice. We report on inquiries, consultations and procedures that came from our work.' },
];
---
<section id="why" class="container-lux py-28 md:py-40" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-20">
    <div class="relative lg:col-span-5" data-reveal="left">
      <div class="img-round img-zoom aspect-[4/5]">
        <img src="/images/brittney-studio.webp" alt="Brittany at work with her laptop, camera and marketing strategy books" width="896" height="1119" loading="lazy" class="object-[50%_35%]" />
      </div>
      <figure class="absolute -bottom-8 right-4 max-w-[17rem] rounded-[14px] border border-ivory/15 bg-obsidian/75 p-6 backdrop-blur-xl md:-right-8">
        <blockquote class="font-display text-lg font-light leading-snug text-ivory">“We closed 10 surgeries from that campaign.”</blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-3 text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-champagne">Client campaign result</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal="right" style="--d:.12s">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why Luminary</p>
      <h2 id="why-title" class="h-display mt-6 text-4xl md:text-6xl">You started a practice, <span class="text-gold-shine font-medium">not a content studio.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead mt-7 max-w-xl">You deserve a marketing partner who understands the aesthetic industry and can turn your brand vision into a digital presence that converts.</p>

      <ul data-stagger class="mt-12 divide-y divide-ivory/10 border-y border-ivory/10">
        {points.map((p) => (
          <li class="row-hover grid gap-2 py-6 md:grid-cols-[17rem_1fr] md:gap-10">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-normal text-ivory">{p.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-7 text-ivory/65">{p.text}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <a href="/about" class="link-lux mt-10 inline-block">About Luminary</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
